      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://cfallspainting.com/montrose-ghent-ohio-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "By the late 20th century Montrose evolved into a major retail corridor along Route 18, thanks to its proximity to Interstate 77.",
